sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser Client
    participant AuthProxy as Auth Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant BFF as Go BFF Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant Gateway as OpenShell Gateway<br/>50051/TCP gRPC

    Note over Browser,Gateway: Flow 1: Authenticated API Request
    Browser->>AuthProxy: GET /api/v1/workspaces<br/>OIDC session cookie
    AuthProxy->>AuthProxy: Validate session<br/>Extract access token
    AuthProxy->>BFF: GET /api/v1/workspaces<br/>x-forwarded-access-token: <JWT>
    BFF->>BFF: Auth middleware extracts token<br/>Sets Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
    BFF->>Gateway: gRPC ListWorkspaces<br/>Bearer token relay<br/>TLS 1.2+ / optional mTLS
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate JWT against OIDC JWKS<br/>Enforce workspace RBAC
    Gateway-->>BFF: WorkspaceList response
    BFF-->>AuthProxy: JSON response
    AuthProxy-->>Browser: JSON response

    Note over Browser,Gateway: Flow 2: Interactive Terminal (WebSocket)
    Browser->>AuthProxy: GET /api/v1/.../terminal<br/>Upgrade: websocket<br/>OIDC session cookie
    AuthProxy->>BFF: WS Upgrade<br/>x-forwarded-access-token: <JWT>
    BFF->>Gateway: gRPC ExecSandboxInteractive<br/>Bidirectional stream<br/>Bearer token
    loop Terminal I/O
        Browser->>BFF: WS text frame (stdin)
        BFF->>Gateway: gRPC stream write
        Gateway-->>BFF: gRPC stream read (stdout)
        BFF-->>Browser: WS text frame (stdout)
    end
    Browser->>BFF: WS close
    BFF->>Gateway: Close gRPC stream

    Note over Browser,Gateway: Flow 3: File Upload (Raw Exec)
    Browser->>AuthProxy: POST /api/v1/.../files<br/>multipart/form-data<br/>OIDC session cookie
    AuthProxy->>BFF: POST multipart<br/>x-forwarded-access-token: <JWT>
    BFF->>BFF: rawexec.go bypasses SDK<br/>Constructs raw protobuf
    BFF->>Gateway: gRPC ExecSandbox<br/>Non-TTY stdin (binary-safe)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / optional mTLS
    Gateway-->>BFF: Exec result
    BFF-->>AuthProxy: JSON response
    AuthProxy-->>Browser: Upload result

    Note over Browser,Gateway: Flow 4: Frontend Bootstrap (Unauthenticated)
    Browser->>BFF: GET /api/v1/auth/config<br/>(No auth required)
    BFF-->>Browser: JSON: auth state, feature flags,<br/>admin role, logout URL
